			"notes": "## What is new in 1.21.1-0.2.0-alpha\n\n- Added Marks, powerful permanent effects to curse your foes and buff yourself and allies. Marks are applied by using a\n  Marking Ritual\n- Added Spell Type Rune, which allows the caster to place a \"mine\" on the ground\n- Added Crafting Recipes for all the items and blocks\n- Added Rune Bracelet and GUI to help with spellcasting\n- Added some patchouli documentation\n- Added a very small config\n- Added Textures for the Mana Generator\n- Fixed Mana Networks not splitting correctly\n- Fixed Mana Concentrator upgrades not working"
